      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA and Microsoft are extending their full-stack collaboration to help organizations build, customize and deploy intelligent applications — from next-generation infrastructure on Azure to industrial systems and Windows PCs.",
